(Agricultural fields across rural states \(e.g., Punjab, Haryana, Madhya Pradesh, Maharashtra\) frequently experience) Tj
T* (intermittent mobile network blind spots and sporadic power outages. Modern enterprise platforms built on synchronous) Tj
T* (cloud-only REST architectures fail in these environments: requests hang, sessions timeout, and pending transactions are) Tj
T* (lost. A resilient agricultural platform must guarantee seamless offline operation, persisting listings, diagnostics, and bids) Tj
T* (locally on device and automatically synchronizing them upon network restoration.) Tj
