(Digital agricultural auction systems frequently suffer from predatory "bid sniping," where opportunistic algorithmic buyers) Tj
T* (submit marginally higher bids in the final fraction of a second before auction close. This deprives the selling farmer of true) Tj
T* (competitive price discovery and prevents genuine regional buyers from matching or exceeding the offer. A fair system) Tj
T* (requires dynamic, concurrency-guarded auction extensions.) Tj
